  <description>
    <p>
      Thunderbird Tray keeps an eye on your Thunderbird profiles and shows the
      number of unread messages directly in the system tray. When new mail
      arrives the icon blinks until you open Thunderbird.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Unread counter for every monitored inbox</li>
      <li>Blinking tray icon with an unread badge</li>
      <li>Quick access to Thunderbird, mail check and settings</li>
      <li>Supports native, Flatpak and Snap installations of Thunderbird</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.juangiler.thunderbird-tray.desktop</launchable>

